          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>（出租土地供計畫興建之基地）</text:p><text:p>面積未達三百三十平方公尺</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>□標售(興建)地</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>□其他依新北市市有財產管理自治條例第 32 條第__款</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>□</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>附繳證件</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p>如應繳證件一覽表內編號第　　　號共　　　件</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
